.sp
For general discussion, please subscribe to the \m[blue]\fBDBMail general mailing list\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[2]\d\s+2
.sp
If you experience an issue with DBMail, please report it on the \m[blue]\fBDBMail Bug Tracker\fR\m[]\&\s-2\u[3]\d\s+2\&. It may be helpful to have a debug log available\&.
